Z||000006||stimpy||07-16-2000||10:24 PM||||Here's where most of the modifications are...<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=258191&a=1921599&p=16712481&Sequence=5">  <BR>The engine has a mild rebuild, bored .030, forged pistons, crank, etc. etc. I added Accel SuperCoil and spiral core wires. Also added a K&N filtercharger which really impressed my ass-o-meter. No dyno run on that yet, shaun.<BR>Since these pics, I got the back and side windows tinted. I also fabricated an enclosure for a 10" subwoofer and have a 440w amp driving it.  So mostly my mods are of the cosmetic and aesthetic variety. <P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://gifs123.tripod.com/page15/renstimpy2.gif">   <BR><p>[This message has been edited by stimpy (edited 07-16-2000).]||||reg||1
